# 🤖 Smartify AI – Customer Support Chatbot

An AI-powered customer support chatbot built with Python, Streamlit, and Google Gemini.

## Features

- 🤖 Gemini AI customer support
- 📄 PDF knowledge base
- 🔍 Document-based question answering
- 💬 Chat history
- ⚡ Streaming AI responses
- 📚 Source references
- 🎫 Human support ticket system
- 🌐 Streamlit Cloud deployment

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- Google Gemini API
- PyPDF
- RAG / document retrieval
- GitHub
- Streamlit Cloud

## How to Run

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python -m streamlit run app.py
